<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP FOUR QUALIFYING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP FOUR QUALIFYING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup Asian zone</p>
<p>group four qualifying matches played in Tokyo on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Oman 2 Macao 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Mohamed Al Araimi 44, Ahmed Ali Hassan 89</p>
<p>Japan 3 Nepal 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Akinori Nishizawa 45, Kazuyoshi Miura 73, 87</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L   F  A  Pts</p>
<p> Japan		  5  5  0  0  30  0   15</p>
<p> Oman		   5  4  0  1  13  1   12</p>
<p> Nepal		  5  0  1  4   1 17    1</p>
<p> Macao		  5  0  1  4   1 27    1</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 28, in Tokyo - Macao v Nepal, Japan</p>
<p>v Oman.</p>
</text>
